The '''Jabiim Hidden Path safehouse ''' was a [[Hidden Path]] safehouse housed in an abandoned sanitation depot on [[Jabiim]]. The secret staging grounds provided the Hidden Path with a place to arrange safe passage and new identities to provide relative safety for [[Force-sensitive]] fugitives of the [[Galactic Empire]].<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|jabiim-hidden-path-safehouse|Jabiim Hidden Path safehouse}}</ref> After the safehouse is discovered by the [[Inquisitorius]] and [[Attack on Jabiim|attacked]], it is abandoned.<ref name="DoR:TVG">''[[Star Wars: Dawn of Rebellion: The Visual Guide]]''</ref>

